<title>INDONESIA: BNI Q1 net up 11.4 pct - report.</title>
<headline>BNI Q1 net up 11.4 pct - report.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian PT Bank Negara Indonesia (BNI) posted a consolidated net profit of 115.4 billion rupiah in the first quarter of 1997, or up 11.4 percent against the year-ago period, Bisnis Indonesia newspaper reported.</p>
<p>The bank's total assets were at 35.9 trillion rupiah in the first quarter of 1997, or up 13.6 percent against the same period last year, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
